It vendors, unmodified, the CIP-0056 token-standard interface DARs from the
Splice 0.7.1 release (vendor/splice-0.7.1/), which are licensed under the
Apache License 2.0 by Digital Asset (Switzerland) GmbH and the Splice
contributors. Their license is kept alongside them at
vendor/splice-0.7.1/LICENSE.

They are vendored rather than fetched so that a clone builds with no network
and no host-specific setup, and so that the bytes a build resolves against are
the bytes that were vetted on the network.
